      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YOU SEXY THING (6) has been freshened with 39 days and makes her stable debut for the Doudle camp. Her NSW form reads strongly and her recent jumpout suggest she has held her form. Can make a winning start in the new colours. AMALFI DREAMER (3) was an eye-catcher on debut before being sent forward here last start and scoring with plenty in hand. Progressive type that can win again. MRS PENNY CRACKER  (7) flashed home into a midfield finish when resuming here three weeks ago. Will appreciate the rise in trip and be licking her lips at the anticipated tempo. Watch for her launching late. AUSTRALIA FOREVER (2) has come back in good order and is another mare that can burst through late. EXTRA HOT (4) has been leaving herself with too much to do when straightening but keeps Holder and is another that can get going late.",
